The whole of esphome/oled-remote/ is therefore GPL-3.0 (see LICENSE), unlike
the rest of home-gateway, which is MIT.

Changes from upstream: the Home Assistant transport (homeassistant-platform
sensors and homeassistant.service calls) is replaced with HTTP GraphQL calls to
this repository's gateway; the AC, covers and automations modes and the
quick-action overlay are removed; a media-player mode is added; the entity list
is discovered at runtime rather than hardcoded; fonts are fetched via gfonts
instead of a vendored TTF.
